# 18. Automated Test Engine

Adaptation must not occur without testing.

The Automated Test Engine evaluates proposed policy changes against:

* existing functionality,
* security rules,
* known attack patterns,
* regression tests,
* repository-specific constraints,
* policy consistency.

A simplified process is:

```text
Proposed Policy
      ↓
Generate Test Cases
      ↓
Execute Tests
      ↓
Evaluate Results
      ↓
PASS ─────────→ Candidate for Deployment
FAIL ─────────→ Reject / Revise
```

